# bolloon chat transport (commits-as-messages) runtime state
# 整个 .comm/ 目录不能 ignore — 它就是消息的载体.
# 但 _state (cursor/seen/lock) 和 _inbox 是本机运行态, 不该 commit.
.comm/_state/
.comm/_inbox/
